      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "recto, right margin (postscript)",
          "value": "<p>For your noble self best greetings, and for whoever is embraced by your care best greetings, first and foremost the two esteemed brothers, they and their children. May the God of Israel bless them, guard them and keep them! May He fulfill in them the verse \u201cYour sons will succeed your ancestors\u201d! I greet them with the best, </p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
