          "value": "<p>most excellent greetings. Also for my lord Sheikh Abu\u0304 Sa\u02bfi\u0304d and his children and mother best greetings. And for my lord Sheikh Abu\u0304 Ri\u1e0da\u0304 Isaac and his children (and) Sheikh Abu \u02bel-Maka\u0304rim best greetings. And peace.</p>",
